  "answerable": true,
  "answer": "Not for sleeping, I'm afraid. With the rear seats in, you can sit up on the BikerBed comfortably or use it as a sofa, but to sleep on it or fully extend it you'll need to take the rear seats out. When it's fully extended, it takes up the whole rear of the van. Once the initial setup is done, the BikerBed can be removed or refitted in under 30 minutes. That's easier with two people, but you can do it on your own.",
